  "name": "AI for everyone - WhatsApp AI Receptionist",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## AI for everyone - WhatsApp AI Receptionist\n\n**Setup (5 steps)**\n1. Create a Google Sheet with 4 tabs: **Info** (key, value), **Menu** (category, item, price_ugx, description, available), **FAQ** (question, answer), **Bookings** (timestamp, customer_phone, customer_name, party_size, date, time, notes, status).\n2. In **Config**: paste the Sheet ID and the owner's WhatsApp number (digits only, with country code, e.g. 2567XXXXXXXX).\n3. Connect credentials: WhatsApp Trigger, WhatsApp send nodes (x3, also set your Phone Number ID), Google Sheets (x4), DeepSeek.\n4. Activate the workflow and set the Production webhook URL in Meta.\n5. Owner must message the business number once every 24h (or use an approved template) so Meta allows alerts to be delivered.",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 4
      },
